WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:15.461
It's like having a blade swinging above your head.

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:17.042
Something may happen.

00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:21.304
You don't know when and you don't know why or where.

00:00:27.808 --> 00:00:31.291
I can hear the yelling going on and I'm going to try and get some help to you now.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.411
So just hold while I call 000.

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:34.992
P.K.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.923
Charging towards me and he grabbed my neck saying,

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:47.643
I'll kill you,

00:00:47.722 --> 00:00:48.362
I'll kill you.

00:00:50.103 --> 00:00:53.245
