00:01:14.414 --> 00:01:15.634
That was his favourite one.

00:01:18.518 --> 00:01:21.500
My big fear is that our kids will end up like us.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:27.265
If we keep pushing someone into a corner,

00:01:28.125 --> 00:01:29.286
what do you think's going to happen?

00:01:29.686 --> 00:01:30.167
Yeah,

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:33.429
and she'd be freaked out the way that I'm acting at the moment because it's possessive,

00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:35.051
like,
just psycho.

00:01:40.848 --> 00:01:47.091
I get clients where police have attended or he's pushed her and shoved her and then the first thing she's done is got her keys,

00:01:47.191 --> 00:01:48.852
got into the car and left.

00:01:49.673 --> 00:01:51.213
And then spoken to him saying,

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:52.574
I can't do this anymore,

00:01:52.575 --> 00:01:53.395
you need to get help.

00:01:54.816 --> 00:01:56.156
