00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:56.657
We've got

00:02:00.439 --> 00:02:01.599
Susco, David,

00:02:04.921 --> 00:02:05.421
Ken,

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:06.201
Justin,

00:02:08.242 --> 00:02:09.522
Micah and Nathan.

00:02:11.656 --> 00:02:13.277
