00:02:14.078 --> 00:02:15.199
I know I've changed.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.240
We don't have to live like this.

00:02:20.483 --> 00:02:22.443
What's at stake is my family.

00:02:50.128 --> 00:02:51.769
Start focusing on your breath.

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:59.252
Just breathe in and taking a nice deep breath and breathing out.

