00:03:49.324 --> 00:03:49.824
Belittled,

00:03:50.686 --> 00:03:51.225
flustered,

00:03:52.546 --> 00:03:53.046
alone,

00:03:53.146 --> 00:03:53.646
stressed,

00:03:53.787 --> 00:03:54.366
confronted,

00:03:54.527 --> 00:03:55.168
agitated,

00:03:55.948 --> 00:03:56.448
uneasy.

00:03:57.688 --> 00:03:58.649
I don't feel heard.

00:03:59.088 --> 00:03:59.990
I feel like yelling.

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:04.372
I feel justified and frustrated.

00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:15.167
I mean,
I was a volunteer and angry and smashed stuff and pushed her around.

00:04:15.168 --> 00:04:17.487
The verbal abuse was terrible.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:24.312
Grabbed the heart of her and pinned her on the bed.

00:04:25.473 --> 00:04:25.973
And I was,

00:04:26.213 --> 00:04:26.713
you know,

00:04:27.113 --> 00:04:27.613
almost,

00:04:28.055 --> 00:04:28.596
well,
I was,

00:04:28.596 --> 00:04:29.375
I was strangling her.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:36.804
I've been doing this for the last 15 years and I've literally worked with hundreds of men.

00:04:37.584 --> 00:04:38.944
There's no typical abuser,

00:04:39.144 --> 00:04:40.826
