00:04:41.547 --> 00:04:43.567
These men come from all walks of life.

00:04:45.049 --> 00:04:46.569
I grew up in an abusive family.

00:04:46.751 --> 00:04:48.412
My father was very loud,

00:04:49.172 --> 00:04:50.133
