00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:20.033
If I hear that there's been an act of violence at home,

00:05:20.552 --> 00:05:24.175
Jackie and I have got a duty of care by law to disclose.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:28.781
Most of them present that they'll do anything.

00:05:28.961 --> 00:05:30.242
